After an update, read-backs that still show the old description are retried, and the description as Linear normalized it is accepted as the one written.
-- seed.json --
{"Issue": [{"id": "1a000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000123", "identifier": "ENG-123", "title": "Verified", "description": "Before"}]}
-- file desired.md --
情况已确认。

+++ 来源与接手

- [来源](https://example.com/反馈)

+ [修复单](https://example.com/case)

+++
-- faults.json --
[{"on": "query:issue", "after": "mutation", "action": "stale", "times": 2}]
-- run --
linear issue update ENG-123 --unprotected --description-file desired.md --json
